// The expected-outcome exceptions of the Basis Library as one datatype. A Basis function that
// raises one of these returns `Result<T, Basis.Error>` in Workman (`markdown/basis-design.md`,
// Basis exceptions). `Overflow`, `Div` and `Size` panic instead and have no constructor here.
// `Io` and `SysErr` join when the Basis IO structures do.
type Error =
  | Empty
  | Subscript
  | Chr
  | Domain
  | Option
  | UnequalLengths
  | Unordered
  | Fail<String>;
